# FIFO Inventory Engine Standard

- Batch Priority: Sort open batches by `received_date ASC` (oldest open lot first).
- Concurrency Locking: Batch inventory reads during sales deductions must utilize PostgreSQL Row-Level Locking (`FOR UPDATE`) to prevent negative stock and race conditions.
- Multi-Batch Split: If order quantity exceeds Batch 1, consume Batch 1 completely and split remainder into subsequent open batches.
- Cost Snapshotting: Lock the exact landed purchase cost snapshot (`cost_snapshot`) on each sales line item for accurate gross margin calculation.
- Unit Conversion: Normalize quantities into child units before batch deductions if sold in parent units.
